type: sequence
title: Checkout Flow

- Client → Gateway: POST /checkout [+]

- opt: cart not empty
  - Gateway → Cart: validate items
  - Cart → Gateway: ok

- alt: payment method
  - Gateway → Stripe: charge card [+]
  - Stripe → Gateway: authorised [-]
  - else:
    - Gateway → Client: 402 Payment Required

- divider: Fulfillment

- par: notify parties
  - Gateway → Email: send receipt
  - and:
    - Gateway → DB: INSERT order

- Gateway → Client: 201 Created [-]
